Depends: agent-sphere (>= 0.2.0-1), redixs (>= 4.1.0-1), comm (>= 1.0.0-1), obsidian (>= 1.13.7), mote-vault-sync (>= 1.1.0-3), mote-vault-syncd (>= 1.1.0-3), init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: Local Ultra infrastructure for Agent Sphere
 Composes Redixs, local Comm with Telegram, Obsidian and vault sync.
 Native service artifacts, owner identity and credentials must be provided
 before activation. The package owns its declarative local startup target.
